  "notes": "{避|さ}ける is an ichidan verb meaning to avoid or evade.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ particle: 〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{避|さ}ける\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{避|さ}けて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ describes ongoing avoidance (he's been avoiding me).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{危険|きけん}→危険：01141_kiken⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{避|さ}ける: to avoid danger\n- ⟦{質問|しつもん}→質問：00888_shitsumon⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{避|さ}ける: to avoid a question\n- ⟦{人混|ひとご}み→人込み：03709_hitogomi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{避|さ}ける: to avoid crowds\n- ⟦{目|め}→目：00525_me⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{避|さ}ける: to avert one's eyes\n\nDON'T CONFUSE (same reading):\n- {避|さ}ける: to avoid\n- ⟦{裂|さ}ける→裂ける：02283_sakeru⟧: to tear, to split (intransitive)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {避|さ}ける: to avoid (conscious choice)\n- ⟦{逃|に}げる→逃げる：01151_nigeru⟧: to escape, run away (physical flight)",
